\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  market surprised by yen  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  method. \b0\par\par\uc2 355 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 April 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, April 9 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was caught on the hop on Thursday not only by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy yen but also by the way it was done. \par \par \uc2  Dealers in London said the U.S. Federal Reserve, which was acting on behalf of the Bank of Japan, had placed orders on EBS, a screen-based interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealing system run by EBS Partnership. \par \par \uc2  "I've never seen anything like that before," said one London dealer. "Maybe they feel they get more bang for the buck that way." \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Fed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is usually conducted through traditional, voice-based interbank brokers. \par \par \uc2  The Fed generally does not comment on whether it has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  but a Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ )official confirmed the Fed had assisted the BOJ in buying yen for dollars. \par \par \uc2  Screen-based dealing is generally anonymous with traders unaware of their counterparty until after the transaction, and even then the identity is usually only a dealing code. \par \par \uc2  Although dealers can quickly identify the counterparty once they know the dealing code, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action through an electronic broking service has usually been seen as a low-key approach to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "It is very strange that the Fed would use EBS instead of going directly to the banks," said another London \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers said that once it can be determined an electronic dealing service counterparty is a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on its mind, the message soon becomes clear not to stand in the way. Dealers will position themselves accordingly and thus accelerate the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's intended move. \par \par \uc2  London dealers said today's Fed action was relatively small in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  terms with some estimates put at just over $500 million. \par \par \uc2  But it managed to send dollar/yen crashing around four yen to a low in European trading of 129.50 yen, a feat the Bank of Japan has not always been able to achieve on its own with greater amounts of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds. ((Andrew Reierson, London newsroom +44 171 542 6745, uk.\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 .news@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du4907mna\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
