\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Roundup/Dlr/Y135 -3: BOJ Action Confirmed \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 April 1998\par 08:14\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The dollar reached a new intraday high of Y135.10 at 0535 GMT, but fell sharply to around Y134.00 at 0540 GMT on unconfirmed talk that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell dollars. However, other participants were doubtful, pointing out that the dollar rebounded sharply to Y134.75 at 0547 GMT. \par \par \uc2  'We haven't heard anything about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said Minoru Shiori, assistant \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at Nippon Credit Bank. 'The dollar dropped, but found support and has come back. It may be just profit-taking.' \par \par \uc2  Before the dollar's sharp move down, market participants had said that there could be option-related selling around Y135.00. \par \par \uc2  'When the market tries Y135.00, there is likely to be defensive option-related selling,' said Nakauchi at Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi. 'That could send the dollar down.' \par \par \uc2  Late in Tokyo, however, a Japanese monetary official told Dow Jones Newswires that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $200 million around Y135.00. \par \par \uc2  But the likelihood of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  being truly effective given \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's poor economic outlook was questioned by traders across the board. \par \par \uc2  'I don't think the BOJ can really \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  effectively at this point,' said a Japanese bank trader. 'The Moody's report, the tankan, the recent (gross domestic product) data.... It all points to a yen sell-off.' \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 03-04-98 \par \par \uc2  0614GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4302tal\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
