\par\par \b \uc2  Japanese individuals eye BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  - dealers. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Kanta Watanabe \par \uc2 449 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 April 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, April 1 (Reuters) - "When is the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  going to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to sell dollars?" \par \par \uc2  Foreign banks in Tokyo offering foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  denominated deposits were swamped with such inquiries from Japanese individual investors as a new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  law took effect in Japan on Wednesday, dealers in Tokyo said. \par \par \uc2  The new law liberalised all cross-border capital transactions except in the case of economic sanctions and some direct investments. Expectations that the liberalisation will result in increased capital outflow and therefore a weaker yen have fueled strong interest in foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  deposits. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said individual investors were hoping for \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that would provide a dollar buying opportunities. \par \par \uc2  Minoru Matsuda, vice president of global \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at Citibank , said there have been many inquiries recently from investors about the bank's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  deposits. \par \par \uc2  He said his bank collected about $85 million worth of yen on December 17 from individual investors after the BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and pushed the dollar down to around 125 yen from 131 yen. \par \par \uc2  Other dealers said customers were particularly interested to know if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  Senior officials at \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) recently have repeatedly warned that it could take action against weakness in the yen. \par \par \uc2  Vice Finance Minister for International Affairs Eisuke Sakakibara said on Wednesday that the yen's fall beyond 133 yen to the dollar was excessive. \par \par \uc2  The dollar stood around 132.82/92 yen at 0825 GMT in Tokyo, after rising as high as 133.90 yen earlier. \par \par \uc2  But dealers said there is speculation that MOF might be hesitant about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market so soon after the enactment of the new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  law, as such a step might hurt individuals already holding dollar-denominated deposits. \par \par \uc2  The new law is expected to result in more Japanese investors seeking higher returns abroad, as Japanese interest rates remain stuck at record-low levels. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ's official discount rate has been at an all-time low of 0.5 percent since September 1995. \par \par \uc2  Many individual investors have moved ahead of the enactment of the new \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  law. \par \par \uc2  The balance of foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  denominated deposits at Citibank in Japan at the end of 1997 was about 50 percent higher compared with the end of 1996, a spokesman for the bank said. \par \par \uc2  "About the same pace of growth has continued for the first three months of this year," he added. \par \par \uc2  The bank does not disclose the exact figure of its foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  deposits. \par \par \uc2  ((Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3 3432 9780 \par \par \uc2  tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du4108c9y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
