\par\par \b \uc2  Dlr steady vs yen by midday, buying demand robust. \b0\par\par\uc2 534 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab  0300 GMT\tab      TRADED HIGH/LOW AS OF 0300 GMT\par  USD/JPY     130.48/51\tab \tab    130.70-129.95\par  USD/DEM     1.8270/72\tab \tab    1.8285-1.8260\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ---------------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2      TOKYO, March 30 (Reuters) - The dollar held on to its gains \par \par \uc2  by midday on Monday as the stock market shed some of its \par \par \uc2  earlier gains, but the topside was capped by lingering caution \par \par \uc2  over Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The downside was well-bid due to buying from overseas \par \par \uc2  operators and expectations of large commercial dollar buying on \par \par \uc2  Tuesday, when institutions in Tokyo close their books. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar is likely to be supported until early Tuesday morning, with a large amount of commercial dollar buying rumoured at the local fixing," said a dealer at a U.S. bank. \par \par \uc2  The buying may partly stem from Japanese banks, related to writing-off of their bad loans to Asia and other regions. Japanese banks usually raise dollar-denominated funds for such lending and a decision to write off loans would require them to to repay their procured funds in dollars, bankers said. \par \par \uc2  "There is a possibility of the emergence of this sort of dollar buying, but we don't know what it amounts to," said a senior trader at a major Japanese bank. \par \par \uc2  Dollar purchases in connection with a setting up of fresh investment trust funds could also support the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. bank dealer said overseas funds remained bullish on the dollar's prospects, with some buying six-month dollar call options with strikes ranging from 135 yen to 140 yen. \par \par \uc2  Despite the announcement of the largest-ever, 16 trillion yen economic stimulus measure last week, there was uncertanity over the details and the amount of real spending. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said it would take time for Japan's economy to pick up even if the government decided on further tax cuts, although sentiment may stop worsening. \par \par \uc2  Taku Yamasaki, policy chief for the Liberal Democratic Party (LDP), said on Sunday that the government would decide about further tax cuts around the time leaders of the Group of Seven (G-7) major industrialised nations meet in mid-May. \par \par \uc2  Remarks from senior \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) officials on Monday had little impact on dollar/yen trade, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Current \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels were excessive, and the MOF maintained the position that it would act decisively against excessive \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements, said senior MOF official Haruhiko Kuroda. In an earlier media report, senior MOF official Eisuke Sakakibara said an excessive yen fall was problematic. \par \par \uc2  "Both remarks had a fleeting impact on the dollar, although there is a lingering fear over BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  near 131 yen," said a bank dealer."But \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be difficult since demand for outright dollar purchases is robust," he said. \par \par \uc2  The key 225-share Nikkei average closed the morning session up 114.29 points or 0.68 percent at 16,853.55. It briefly climbed as high as 17,009.89 soon after opening. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 130.35/45 yen and 1.8260/70 marks in New York on Friday. ((Tatsuo Ito/Tokyo Treasury Desk 81-3 3432-1396 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du3u08dnp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
