\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo -2: Japan LDP To Announce New Econ Package \b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 01:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The mark is trading at Y70.54, unchanged from Y70.54 earlier and just above Y70.50 in New York late Wednesday. The mark was quoted late in Tokyo Wednesday at Y71.18. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.6749, up from $1.6743 earlier and above $1.6742 in New York late Wednesday. Sterling was at $1.6730 in Tokyo late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The special wariness about BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  comes amid speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in tandem with an announcement by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ruling Liberal Democratic Party of an economic package. That announcement is expected to come around 0800 GMT (3:00 a.m. EST) Thursday. \par \par \uc2  In the past, the BOJ has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on several occassions in tandem with the announcement of important policy initiatives. \par \par \uc2  Japan's financial daily Nihon Keizai Shimbun reported Thursday morning that the package would likely be worth Y12 trillion, with public works spending as its main pillar. \par \par \uc2  'We're not interested in the contents of package, since an income tax cut is unlikely to be included,' said Shigeko Watase, a trader at Nippon Credit Bank. 'Our focus is exclusively on whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  As a result, the dollar is seen trading against the yen in a wide range, dealers said. Many expect the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to float between Y127.80-Y129.60 for the rest of the Asian day. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 'If \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  doesn't take place, however, the dollar is likely to\par be hemmed in a narrow trading range around Y129.00,' NCB's Watase said.\par The dollar is also seen trading between DM1.8250-DM1.8300.\par By Takeshi Takeuchi 813-5255-2934; ttakeuchi@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 26-03-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0057GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du3q02knf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
