\par\par \b \uc2  Dlr hit by BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  but off lows at noon. \b0\par\par\uc2 526 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab  0300 GMT\tab      TRADED HIGH/LOW AS OF 0300 GMT\par  USD/JPY     129.85/88\tab \tab    131.30-128.95\par  USD/DEM     1.8310/13\tab \tab    1.8335-1.8278\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ---------------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2      TOKYO, March 20 (Reuters) - The dollar was knocked down \par \par \uc2  against the yen by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ)'s dollar-selling \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but was off earlier falls at midday on Friday due \par \par \uc2  to robust buying from overseas funds and Japanese investors. \par \par \uc2  Caution over further BOJ dollar-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  here \par \par \uc2  and overseas later in the day through European central banks \par \par \uc2  was capping dollar's rise ahead of weekend, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "There is a fear that the BOJ may again step in to sell dollars in early afternoon in a bid to push the dollar down far below 130 yen," said a dealer at a European bank. \par \par \uc2  "A caution that European central banks may sell dollars on behalf of BOJ later in overseas markets is also making traders cautious to keep dollar long positions," he added. \par \par \uc2  The dollar earlier climbed to its high of 131.30 yen, triggered by remarks from newly appointed Bank of Japan Governor Masaru Hayami, who was quoted by Jiji News Agency as saying on Friday there was no point in fretting over every \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  move. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ soon sold dollars and pushed the level down below 129 yen. Traders said the BOJ appeared to have sold dollars through a combination of an electronic broking system and conventional brokers. \par \par \uc2  In an unusual move, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  appeared to have avoided using major commercial banks for its dollar sales and instead asked a few smaller banks to handle them. \par \par \uc2  "The way that BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market caught traders off guard and was effective, but there's no guarantee that such a measure will have a similar effect next time," said a senior trader at a foreign bank in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2  "I think that the monetary authorities may be attacked by market forces in return, although they won the first round," said the trader. \par \par \uc2  A bullish sentiment for the dollar could continue amid lack of buying factors for the yen, except BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said a bank dealer. He said some overseas hedge funds started buying dollars actively on assumption that the dollar could head towards 140 yen after a revision of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  control law takes effect on April 1. \par \par \uc2  "If they assume that the dollar will eventually rise to 140 yen, the current level would be a bargain," he said. \par \par \uc2  The ruling Liberal Democratic Party (LDP) will announce the outline of an economic stimulus plan as early as next Wednesday, but the government will not flesh out the package until April, Japanese media reported on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said they were focusing on whether there would be any surprises or income tax cuts in the outline of the economic package, and that dollar selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would take place in tandem with the event. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 130.70/80 yen and 1.8230/25 marks in New York on Thursday. ((Tatsuo Ito/Tokyo Treasury Desk 81-3 3432-1396 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du3k092mu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
