\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo: Dlr Slightly Up Vs Yen In Range Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 304 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 1998\par 01:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--The possibility of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the yen and expectations, mainly from foreign investors, of additional economic stimulus measures kept the dollar locked in a range in early morning trading in Tokyo Friday. \par \par \uc2  Around 0030 GMT (7:30 p.m. EST), the dollar is trading at Y132.78, down from Y132.85 around 0001 GMT (7:01 p.m. EST) but slightly above Y132.75 in New York late Monday. The dollar was quoted at Y132.10 late in Tokyo Monday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has changed hands in a narrow range of Y132.75 to Y132.93 in Tokyo Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said that the dollar had hard support against the yen at the Y131 level from Japanese institutional investors with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  fears kicking in around Y133.50, capping the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Although some traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  fears are gradually thinning day-by-day, others said it was just the lull before the storm when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  unleashes a torrent of dollar selling. \par \par \uc2  'The fear is that because there haven't been specific comments last week concerning \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  coming out of talks between the U.S. and \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , when they do it, they'll really do it,' said a Tokyo-based trader at a European bank. \par \par \uc2  Eisuke Sakakibara, the finance ministry's vice minister for international affairs, was in the U.S. last week to talk to U.S. financial officials, including Deputy U.S. Treasury Secretary Lawrence Summers. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at DM1.8192 lower than DM1.8215 earlier and below DM1.8230 late Monday in New York. The dollar was at DM1.8223 in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 13-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0046GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 1863 4162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du1d009x4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
