ng Committee Chairman James Leach is\par scheduled to depart Jan. 15 for a three-nation fact-finding\par tour of Asia. The tour is designed partly to address\par questions over the IMF's role in fighting financial-market\par crises.\par    -- Hong Kong shares dropped Wednesday, closing down\par almost 6% on Southeast Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  jitters, and fears of\par a Hong Kong interest rate rise.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  01-07-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1125EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4190 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du17003oj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
