\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Impact Expected To Be Temporary:Amplifier \b0\par\par\uc2  By Brian Fowler \par \uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 1998\par 11:54\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Traders in Tokyo proved once again Tuesday that you can't keep a good dollar down, as they bought the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the wake of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  attempts to support the yen through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Market participants said the BOJ and its partners at \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  continue to fight a losing battle in trying to cap the dollar's rise versus the yen. \par \par \uc2  'The fundamentals of the U.S. economy are so strong that no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  can stop the dollar's rise,' said Koichi Kubo, assistant manger of international \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  group at Dai-ichi Kangyo Bank. \par \par \uc2  Weak fundamentals in Japan, ongoing turmoil in Asian markets and steady economic growth in the U.S. will probably encourage traders to take advantage of every dip in the dollar to buy the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  again, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ entered the market early in the Tokyo session, just after the dollar had strengthened to Y134.30, its highest level since April 27, 1992, when it touched an intraday high of Y134.95. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ dollar sales - confirmed by a Japanese monetary source on condition of anonymity - initially knocked the dollar more than one yen lower. But the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  clawed its way back to end Asian trading at Y133.65, up from Y133.58 late Monday in New York. \par \par \uc2  It was the first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the BOJ since mid-December, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold between $8.0 billion and $10 billion over a three-day period to push the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower from Y131.50 to below Y127.00 temporarily. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 06-01-98 \par \par \uc2  1054GMT \par \par \uc2  1138 4204 62554 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du16002sc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
