\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Roundup -2: Market Expects Dlr To Rise To Y135 \b0\par\par\uc2 336 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 1998\par 07:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at Y73.06, down from Y73.19 in New York late Monday but above Y73.40 in London late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.6282, down from $1.6300 in New York late Monday. Sterling was at $1.6267 in London late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Further declines in most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  also limited the effect of the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buoy the yen. \par \par \uc2  Indonesia's rupiah fell to an all-time low of IDR7,700 against the dollar in thin trading and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was quoted at 7,387.5 to the dollar at 0507 GMT (12:07 a.m. EST). \par \par \uc2  The Taiwanese dollar posted a ten-and-a-half-year low against the dollar. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dropped to as low as NT$33.850 to the dollar at 0145 GMT (8:45 p.m. EST) and is now trading at NT$33.731. \par \par \uc2  '`Japan Selling' has now turned into 'Asia Selling,'' said Hirokazu Note, senior trader at Sumitomo Bank. 'As long as 'Asia Selling' continues, the yen cannot escape from the present selloff.' \par \par \uc2  Market participants are now focusing on whether there will be joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by central banks of industrialized nations to stem the dollar's rise. \par \par \uc2  'Joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is possible,' said Note, citing a recent quick drop of the mark against the dollar as a reason. 'If the mark further drops to DM1.85 (to the dollar), the German \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may toe the line with the BOJ.' \par \par \uc2  On the other hand, some traders are doubtful about the prospect of joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  or even its impact. \par \par \uc2  'The U.S. is still comfortable with the strong dollar, and even a joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  cannot stem market forces in the long term,' said a Tokyo-based trader at a European bank. \par \par \uc2  'Regardless of whether there is a joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' Y135 to the dollar is surely in sight,' said Dai-ichi Kangyo's Kubo. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 06-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0604GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du160024h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
